421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 278 0 R
/T (Push Pull Legs Push Pull Legs. Sticking to such a split gets results extremely fast. Not only are you hitting all muscle groups twice a week, but you are giving the push pull and legs muscles 2 focused sessions each. In full body training your focus is spread out over many muscles, and you usually tire after the first few exercises, meaning full body training days can tire you before maximally working your entire body. With 2 targeted push pull legs a week, you are dialling in on those areas more effectively. )
/E (Push Pull Legs Push Pull Legs. Sticking to such a split gets results extremely fast. Not only are you hitting all muscle groups twice a week, but you are giving the push pull and legs muscles 2 focused sessions each. In full body training your focus is spread out over many muscles, and you usually tire after the first few exercises, meaning full body training days can tire you before maximally working your entire body. With 2 targeted push pull legs a week, you are dialling in on those areas more effectively. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
