<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 286 0 R
/T (This is a cardio session that makes use of movements where we go as fast as we can. To truly go as fast as we can, we do not tire ourselves out with high repetitions, we do no more than 5 repetitions per set, and then do some active rest \(light movement with a different exercise\) before starting another speed set. This will make you faster athletically, to help you in any sports classes or exercise classes.)
/E (This is a cardio session that makes use of movements where we go as fast as we can. To truly go as fast as we can, we do not tire ourselves out with high repetitions, we do no more than 5 repetitions per set, and then do some active rest \(light movement with a different exercise\) before starting another speed set. This will make you faster athletically, to help you in any sports classes or exercise classes.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
